						{ 
							"Type": "Paragraph", 
							"Text": "    Minor Arcana, vol. 1, serves as an excellent introduction into the world of spellcasting. Those wishing to learn the art of magic are advised, first and foremost, that magic always comes with a cost, whether it be material or at the magician's own expense. Treat each spell in here with caution; I have done my best to annotate estimates of each spell's effects where possible.\n    As a novice, some spells will not be possible to perform immediately. With practice comes expertise, and with expertise comes a wider and stronger range of abilities.", 
