					"Elements": [
						{ 
							"Type": "Paragraph", 
							"Text": "    For beginners who are not supplied with an inordinate amount of ghostly energy like myself, I recommend first attempting to perform the Pyrales Invocare spell. It only consumes a small portion of energy, and requires one torch to cast.\n    I wish you best of luck in your endeavours.\n\n    Edwin Payne", 
